# Zuko's Conviction ({B} instant): return target creature card from YOUR graveyard to your hand. Bot1's Ornithopter is bolted
# on turn 1; Bot2's own Ornithopter is in its graveyard from turn 2. Refused as targets: Bot2's Ornithopter (not your graveyard),
# the Lightning Bolt in Bot1's graveyard (not a creature card). Unkicked (only {B} paid), the Ornithopter returns to Bot1's hand,
# not the battlefield, and Bot2's graveyard is untouched.

